<title>SPAIN: BCH to buy Banco de Colombia stake.</title>
<headline>BCH to buy Banco de Colombia stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano (BCH) said on Thursday it had reached an initial agreement to buy a significant stake in Banco de Colombia.</p>
</text>
